# What gets published at studyboardapp.com (wrangler.jsonc serves this folder). Only what the web app and the website load go up;
# everything else in the repository stays private: SQL files, tests, Edge Function and Worker source, tools, build scripts, the desktop
# and phone wrappers, email templates and docs. Same syntax as .gitignore: "/*" leaves out everything at the top level, and each "!" line
# lets one thing back in. When the site needs a new top-level file, add a "!" line for it here.
/*
!/index.html
!/sw.js
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/today.webmanifest
!/_headers
!/vendor/
!/locales/
!/website/
!/icon.png
!/icon-192.png
!/icon-512.png
!/maskable-192.png
!/maskable-512.png
!/apple-touch-icon.png
!/shortcut-*.png
!/today-screenshot.png
!/today-data.json
!/today-template.json
# Inside the folders that are published: no notes, and the website's own copy of the headers (the root _headers is the one in use).
*.md
/website/_headers
